            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-08T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-07T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds easterly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to around 10 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm in the morning and afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h turning south to southeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 14 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
